#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:56
#: 15c562775fb54345bc7ef649cb94bb1b
msgid "Safety Button"
msgstr "安全按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:57
#: b72f6b129c60420fbaec25f45bbafa98
msgid ""
"SkySakura H743 supports safety button, with connection via sh1.0 6 pin "
"connector, with buzzer and safety led on the same connector."
msgstr "SkySakura H743 支持安全按钮，通过 sh1.0 6 针连接器连接，蜂鸣器和安全 LED 在同一连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:59
#: 29753ca531fa4861b3ec9a7854ba103f
msgid ""
"Safety button is defaulted to be disabled but can be enabled by setting the "
"following parameter:"
msgstr "安全按钮默认禁用，可通过设置以下参数启用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:61
#: 22ca42b90b00499192553da5443eafa6
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:64
#: 4e4542052b164059b7733bbd6751d3f0
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:65
#: 36aa1aac11004bf193c888c9e20c081e
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on UART4 with an sh1.0 connector. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. The SBUS pin on the HD VTX connector is tied directly "
"the UART4 RX. If RC is used on UART4, then the SBUS lead from a DJI VTX must"
" not be connected to an SBUS to prevent the RC from no working."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入通过 sh1.0 连接器配置在 UART4 上，支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。HD VTX 连接器上的 SBUS 引脚直接连接至 "
"UART4 RX。若在 UART4 使用 RC，则 DJI VTX 的 SBUS 线不得连接，以防 RC 失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:68
#: 6e5e317956864a929b8d02cdeda2d586
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:69
#: 526487a1f581409b8707d59b3020f452
msgid ""
"SkySakura H743 supports HD VTX DisplayPort OSD through UART6 by default. Set"
" :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 5."
msgstr ""
"SkySakura H743 默认通过 UART6 支持 HD VTX DisplayPort OSD。设置 "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:72
#: bf62d44996004cb68b78f411cf61fb03
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:73
#: 2d2e1dbae33e4145af02ebff4d35e8ed
msgid ""
"The 12VSW output voltage on the HD VTX connector is controlled by GPIO 85, "
"via RELAY1 by default. Relay 1 Low activates the voltage."
msgstr "HD VTX 连接器上的 12VSW 输出电压由 GPIO 85 控制，默认通过 RELAY1 控制。RELAY1 低电平激活电压输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:76
#: ea7d965899c043ada6ad3ff9b0b3242e
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:77
#: 9d4539f54a7241e883365a6a7159779e
msgid ""
"The SkySakura H743 has 13 PWM outputs. M1-M8 are linked to sh1.0 8 pin "
"connectors. The first 8 outputs support bi-directional DShot and DShot. "
"Output 9-13 only support non-DShot protocols and 13 is configured as "
"NEOPIXEL LED by default."
msgstr ""
"SkySakura H743 共有 13 路 PWM 输出。M1-M8 连接至 sh1.0 8 针连接器。前 8 路输出支持双向 DShot 和 "
"DShot。输出 9-13 仅支持非 DShot 协议，第 13 路默认配置为 NEOPIXEL LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:79
#: 12eaa8a583d149659c47faecd2071a75
msgid "The PWM are in in two groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为两组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:81
#: 62f380af5c0648b19ef0602064f38831
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:82
#: fa1b4e50f74d45aaa672a5e6b89ccf04
msgid "PWM 3-4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-4 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:83
#: d9f02a5070554d7dbaead6eab0700c3d
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:84
#: 9dbd70a54d724c5f93d737a3a28c8f31
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 为第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:85
#: 503e42ee3dc14348811a0e523f50aaf9
msgid "PWM 9-12 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 9-12 为第 5 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:86
#: 492374a2b48b44f8a7fc1c7f2522f97c
msgid "PWM 13 in group6"
msgstr "PWM 13 为第 6 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:88
#: 1ac9e6722fbb4c33aa80ff949f5e5027
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:93
#: 783a337e1fc440e2ac7defe2679d346f
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:94
#: be0ef4aac11f4d5a8e60f0a67d17865a
msgid ""
"The board has a builtin voltage sensor and external current monitor inputs. "
"The voltage sensor can handle up to 12S LiPo batteries. The current sensor "
"scale's default range is 120A, but will need to be adjusted according to "
"which sensor is used. These inputs are present on the first ESC connector."
msgstr ""
"该板内置电压传感器和外部电流监测输入。电压传感器最高支持 12S 锂电池。电流传感器量程默认为 120A，需根据所用传感器进行调整。这些输入位于第一个 "
"ESC 连接器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:96
#: ccd4a96cd63e4d0db6d520172fcadc1d
msgid ""
"A second battery monitor can be also used but must be enabled. Its voltage "
"sensor is capable of reading up to 6.6V maximum and is available on the A3 "
"solder pad. Its current monitor input is on the A4 solder pad."
msgstr "还可启用第二路电池监测器。其电压传感器最高可读取 6.6V，位于 A3 焊盘上，电流监测输入位于 A4 焊盘上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:98
#: ed6d3a4de7f4495698fd054c20e201de
msgid "The default battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:100
#: d2eba1b0ef5c448fb7390fd71f00b989
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:101
#: bd8584785fe8468582b271052708d23c
