msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:106
#: 7018ea09e44543728ba7879653aebc08
msgid "A second battery monitor can be enabled:"
msgstr "可启用第二路电池监测器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:108
#: 114f58b3e81e40e8913938ef60d687f8
msgid "set :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:109
#: 02c04a126ab94ae1a7913928a19b0669
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_PIN<BATT2_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_PIN<BATT2_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:110
#: fcd8f47c1be64df28a8bcb2ab4a6ba84
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN<BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN<BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:111
#: 3fecd0a106874ffd847b400b3b1368d3
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_MULT<BATT2_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_MULT<BATT2_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:112
#: 062b5ba0a81149d2b8c6e79825e44335
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT2_AMP_PERVLT<BATT2_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` set  to "
"appropriate value for second current sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT2_AMP_PERVLT<BATT2_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"根据第二路电流传感器设置为适当值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:115
#: 0d0fc950283942e2898c33a7a6da936f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:116
#: f8152920055d41e89281730a77a581ae
msgid ""
"The SkySakura H743 has a built-in IST8310 compass. Due to motor "
"interference, users often disable this compass and use an external compass "
"attached via the external SDA/SCL pins."
msgstr ""
"SkySakura H743 内置 IST8310 罗盘。由于电机干扰，用户通常禁用内置罗盘，改用通过外部 SDA/SCL 引脚连接的外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:119
#: 4e0272f720d84ecab6c1e233e6bfee8f
msgid "NeoPixel LED"
msgstr "NeoPixel LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:120
#: d4c2c6c1b0c24c3eb0fbff0f29449ce7
msgid ""
"PWM13 provides external NeoPixel LED support by default but can be re-"
"configured as a normal motor/servo output."
msgstr "PWM13 默认提供外部 NeoPixel LED 支持，也可重新配置为普通电机/舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:123
#: d94c7579e340405ebe4517fc14a6720a
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:124
#: 71c4aadc6fc94ab4b7c5f4fa24c80129
msgid ""
"Firmware can be found on the `firmware server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__  in the \"SkySakuraH743\" folders."
msgstr ""
"固件可在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的 「SkySakuraH743」 目录中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:127
#: 31417f49af58404880f317ee330cc22c
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:128
#: 800bcfd883a64542b4b03b03875e58aa
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-SkySakuraH743.rst:132
#: 4bbf47dc65294bde825e503c03325f1d
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
